---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");

const stages = [
  { id: "strategy", x: 50, label: "Strategy", sub: "Openclaw / agent" },
  { id: "auth", x: 200, label: "Auth", sub: "Bearer token" },
  { id: "decode", x: 350, label: "Decode", sub: "Solana / Cosmos" },
  { id: "policy", x: 500, label: "Policy", sub: "Caps · allowlists" },
  { id: "replay", x: 650, label: "Replay", sub: "Cache" },
  { id: "hsm", x: 800, label: "YubiHSM2", sub: "Sign in hardware" },
];
---

<section class="relative" aria-labelledby="architecture-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-300"
      >
        How it works
      </p>
      <h2
        id="architecture-heading"
        class="mt-3 text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Five gates between the strategy and your keys.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-lg text-fog-200">
        Every signing request crosses authentication, chain decoding, policy
        evaluation, replay protection, and only then reaches the YubiHSM2.
        Each layer is fail-closed and emits to the audit log.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-900/40 p-3 shadow-card sm:p-5"
    >
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 900 320"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Request lifecycle from strategy to YubiHSM2 with audit and metrics emitted at each step"
          class="block h-auto w-full min-w-[720px]"
        >
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="trust-host" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0f172a" stop-opacity="0.9" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0b1220" stop-opacity="0.9" />
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="trust-hsm" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0c4a6e" stop-opacity="0.55" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#155e75" stop-opacity="0.55" />
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="path-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7dd3fc" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0ea5e9" />
            </linearGradient>
            <filter id="node-glow" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="160%">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="3" result="blur" />
              <feMerge>
                <feMergeNode in="blur" />
                <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" />
              </feMerge>
            </filter>
          </defs>

          <rect
            x="10"
            y="50"
            width="720"
            height="180"
            rx="20"
            fill="url(#trust-host)"
            stroke="rgba(148,163,184,0.18)"
          />
          <text
            x="20"
            y="72"
            fill="#94a3b8"
            font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace"
            font-size="10"
            letter-spacing="2"
          >TRUST: HOST</text>

          <rect
            x="740"
            y="50"
            width="150"
            height="180"
            rx="20"
            fill="url(#trust-hsm)"
            stroke="rgba(56,189,248,0.45)"
            stroke-dasharray="6 4"
          />
          <text
            x="750"
            y="72"
            fill="#7dd3fc"
            font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace"
            font-size="10"
            letter-spacing="2"
          >TRUST: HSM</text>

          <path
            id="flow-path"
            d="M70 140 H 800"
            stroke="url(#path-grad)"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            fill="none"
            opacity="0.55"
            stroke-dasharray="4 6"
          />

          <circle r="6" fill="#7dd3fc" filter="url(#node-glow)">
            <animateMotion dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite" rotate="auto">
              <mpath href="#flow-path" />
            </animateMotion>
            <animate
              attributeName="opacity"
              values="0;1;1;0"
              keyTimes="0;0.1;0.9;1"
              dur="6s"
              repeatCount="indefinite"
            />
          </circle>

          {
            stages.map((s, idx) => (
              <g>
                <circle
                  cx={s.x}
                  cy={140}
                  r="22"
                  fill="rgba(15,23,42,0.95)"
                  stroke={idx === stages.length - 1 ? "#7dd3fc" : "rgba(148,163,184,0.4)"}
                  stroke-width={idx === stages.length - 1 ? 2 : 1}
                />
                <text
                  x={s.x}
                  y={144}
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  fill="#e2e8f0"
                  font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace"
                  font-size="10"
                >
                  {String(idx + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
                </text>
                <text
                  x={s.x}
                  y={102}
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  fill="#f8fafc"
                  font-family="Inter, sans-serif"
                  font-size="13"
                  font-weight="600"
                >
                  {s.label}
                </text>
                <text
                  x={s.x}
                  y={188}
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  fill="#94a3b8"
                  font-family="Inter, sans-serif"
                  font-size="11"
                >
                  {s.sub}
                </text>
              </g>
            ))
          }

          <g>
            <line
              x1="70"
              y1="245"
              x2="730"
              y2="245"
              stroke="rgba(148,163,184,0.25)"
              stroke-width="1"
              stroke-dasharray="2 4"
            />
            <text
              x="70"
              y="262"
              fill="#94a3b8"
              font-family="Inter, sans-serif"
              font-size="11"
            >
              Append-only audit log (JSONL + optional HMAC chain)
            </text>
            <text
              x="730"
              y="262"
              text-anchor="end"
              fill="#94a3b8"
              font-family="Inter, sans-serif"
              font-size="11"
            >
              Prometheus /metrics
            </text>
          </g>

          <g>
            <text
              x="450"
              y="298"
              text-anchor="middle"
              fill="#64748b"
              font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace"
              font-size="10"
              letter-spacing="3"
            >
              FAIL-CLOSED · DENY-BY-DEFAULT · NO PLAINTEXT EGRESS
            </text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">
          <div
            class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-300"
          >
            01 — host plane
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fog-200">
            HTTP, policy, replay cache, audit log, metrics. Runs as a
            hardened systemd service on a dedicated user with
            <code class="font-mono text-accent-300">NoNewPrivileges</code>,
            <code class="font-mono text-accent-300">PrivateTmp</code>, and
            <code class="font-mono text-accent-300">SystemCallFilter</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">
          <div
            class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-300"
          >
            02 — hsm plane
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fog-200">
            Signing keys live only inside the YubiHSM2. The runtime auth key
            can sign but cannot export or mutate keys. Backups are
            wrap-encrypted under a key that never leaves the device.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-4">
          <div
            class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-300"
          >
            03 — observability
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fog-200">
            Every accepted and denied signature lands in the JSONL audit log
            with optional HMAC chaining. Prometheus exports counters for
            sign attempts, denials, and policy reasons.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-fog-300"
      >
        <span>
          Add a chain by implementing the
          <code class="font-mono text-accent-300">ChainSigner</code> trait —
          policy, audit, and metrics are chain-agnostic.
        </span>
        <a
          href={`${baseUrl}/reference/architecture/`}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-accent-300 hover:text-accent-200"
        >
          Full architecture
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
